South Central Honeysuckle
- Panhandle
	do Inventory.add_item("Crowbar", 1, 5)
	set {temp_money} = range(5,21).pick_random()
	set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
	You made {temp_money} money
	Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
	do Global.use_action()
- Break Into Abandoned Cars (Requires Crowbar) | [if {catalytic_found} == false] [else="hide"]
	if {Inventory.has_item("Crowbar")}:
		set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
		if {random_chance} <= 50:
			You found a catalytic converter
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			set {catalytic_found} = true
			set {crowbar_durability} = Inventory.change_durability("Crowbar", -1)
			if {crowbar_durability} <= 0:
				Your crowbar breaks
			else:
				Your crowbar has {crowbar_durability} durability left
			do Global.use_action()
		else:
			You found nothing
			do Inventory.change_durability("Crowbar", -1)
			Your crowbar has {Inventory.get_item_durability("Crowbar")} durability left
			do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You don't have a crowbar
- Sleep Here
	if {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} and {Inventory.has_item("Bullet")}:
		You may spend 1 bullet to lower the risk
		- Spend 1 bullet
			set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
			if {random_chance} <= 80:
				You sleep in the filthy alleyway safely. Fortunately your sleep is undisturbed and your valuables are untouched.  However, you feel like you lost a bit of resolve.
				do Global.change_resolve(0)
				do Global.sleep()
		- Do nothing
			set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
			if {random_chance} <= 50:
				You sleep in the filthy alleyway. Fortunately your sleep is undisturbed and your valuables are untouched. However, you feel like you lost a bit of resolve.
				do Global.change_resolve(0)
				do Global.sleep()
			elif {random_chance} > 50 and {random_chance} < 80:
				Things go awry. You feel like you lost a moderate amount of resolve.
				do Global.change_resolve(-10)
				do Global.sleep()
			else:
				You got shot
				do Global.change_resolve(-100)
	else:
		set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
		if {random_chance} <= 50:
			You sleep in the filthy alleyway. Fortunately your sleep is undisturbed and your valuables are untouched. However, you feel like you lost a bit of resolve.
			do Global.change_resolve(-15)
			do Global.sleep()
		elif {random_chance} > 50 and {random_chance} < 80:
			Things go awry. You feel like you lost a moderate amount of resolve.
			do Global.change_resolve(-10)
			do Global.sleep()
		else:
			do Global.change_resolve(-100)
- Leave